# Rowan launch tour marketing frames: regenerated on demand with
# `flutter test --update-goldens test/rowan_launch_tour_golden_test.dart`.
# They are media artifacts, not CI fixtures (the tour test gates its pixel
# compare behind --update-goldens), so they stay out of the repo. The
# cascadia_dense_layout.png golden is tracked and unaffected by this rule.
test/goldens/tour_*.png
